    "text": "Like dogs that freak out at even the thought of the vet. Most anti - vaxxers are adults stuck with a child's mind, who have an all - consuming infant's fear of needles. It's their unconscious that drives them to seize on any excuse, any argument, not matter how absurd, to avoid the 'jab'. And, the most obvious proof of this is the oral vaccine for Polio has been 90% accepted, along with the fact that anti - vaxxers will happily try any other treatment, irrespective of its totally untested side effects, as long as its not in a needle. Would you expect any other outcome when non-verbal infants, taking their cue from petrified parents, are jabbed with a sharp needle and then shortly after feel sick? Anti - vaxxers, like RFK Jr, need serious therapy to help lift the veil that conceals their true motivation and 'childhood' fear .. before more kids 'unlive'.",
